<p>Semrush is one of the most widely used SEO and marketing platforms, and that makes it useful to side hustlers in two ways. First, the Semrush affiliate program pays a flat commission per new subscriber that dwarfs most percentage-based programs. Second, the tool itself is the engine behind a whole category of freelance work: keyword research, content plans, audits and competitor reports. This guide covers both, with current program terms as of 2026.</p>

