<h2 id="affiliate-terms">Semrush affiliate program terms in 2026</h2>
<p>The program used to be called BeRush and paid a recurring percentage. It now runs on <a href="https://impact.com">Impact</a> and pays a flat amount per new subscription, which varies by product. Semrush, which Adobe acquired in 2026, still runs the program under its own brand. These are the Basic-tier rates published on the <a href="https://www.semrush.com/lp/affiliate-program/en/">Semrush affiliate page</a>; rates change, so check the live terms when you apply.</p>

