</table>

<p>Tiers are based on sales per quarter: Basic (0–4 sales), Silver (5–19), Gold (20–49) and Platinum (50+). Semrush also lists a quarterly content bonus from $200 at Basic to $1,500 at Platinum for qualifying content. Attribution is last-click with a 120-day cookie. Transactions lock 27 days after the end of the month and are paid about 21 days later by electronic funds transfer or PayPal, so expect roughly a seven-week lag from sale to cash.</p>

<div class="callout callout-warn"><strong>Watch out:</strong> Commissions are one-time, not recurring. A $200 SEO Toolkit referral pays $200 once, even if that customer stays for years. Plan your income around new referrals, not a growing residual.</div>

<h2 id="earnings-math">What the affiliate program can realistically earn</h2>
<p>Affiliate income is traffic times conversion times commission. Semrush buyers are professionals with a budget, so a small, well-targeted audience can outearn a big general one. Run your own numbers below: try your monthly clicks, a conservative trial and sale rate, and a $200 commission.</p>

[[tool:affiliate-calculator]]

<p>Remember that trials pay too. Ten trial activations at $10 is $100 even if none convert, which helps new affiliates see results while they build traffic. You can model longer-term scenarios with the <a href="/tools/affiliate-commission-calculator/">affiliate commission calculator</a>.</p>

<h2 id="how-to-join">How to join and start promoting</h2>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><strong>Have a channel first.</strong> A blog, YouTube channel, newsletter or social account about marketing, SEO, blogging or business. Applications are reviewed, and an empty site is likely to be declined.</li>
  <li><strong>Apply through the Semrush affiliate page.</strong> You will be routed to Impact to create an account, add payment details and accept the terms.</li>
  <li><strong>Read the restrictions.</strong> Like most software programs, Semrush limits trademark bidding in paid search and coupon-style promotion. Breaking the rules can void commissions.</li>
  <li><strong>Grab links for specific pages.</strong> Deep link to the free trial, a specific toolkit or a feature page rather than the home page; relevant landing pages convert better.</li>
  <li><strong>Publish content that answers buying questions.</strong> Start with three to five pieces (see below) and add disclosure on every page with affiliate links.</li>
  <li><strong>Track and iterate in Impact.</strong> Watch which pages drive trials, then update and expand those first.</li>
</ol>

<h2 id="content-that-converts">Content that sells Semrush</h2>
<p>People do not buy SEO software from a banner. They buy after seeing it solve a problem. The best-performing affiliate content usually falls into a few types:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Tutorials:</strong> "How to find low-competition keywords," "How to audit a site in an afternoon," with screenshots of Semrush doing the work.</li>
  <li><strong>Comparisons:</strong> Semrush vs. other SEO suites, written honestly. Readers trust a comparison that admits trade-offs.</li>
  <li><strong>Case studies:</strong> What you did on a real site and what happened to traffic. This is where your own SEO work pays off twice.</li>
  <li><strong>Pricing explainers:</strong> Which plan or toolkit fits which kind of user. As of 2026, third-party reviews list the core SEO plans at about $139.95 (Pro), $249.95 (Guru) and $499.95 (Business) per month, with discounts for annual billing; link readers to the official pricing page because it changes.</li>
  <li><strong>Video walkthroughs:</strong> YouTube screen recordings rank in both Google and YouTube search and show the tool in action.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you are new to marketing in general, our <a href="/digital-marketing-side-hustle/">digital marketing side hustle</a> guide covers the fundamentals of building an audience you can promote to.</p>

<h2 id="seo-side-hustle">Using Semrush to run an SEO side hustle</h2>
<p>The other way to earn is to sell what Semrush helps you produce. Small businesses, bloggers and online stores know they need SEO but rarely have time to learn the tools. You can package that work into fixed-price services.</p>

