<p>The strongest approach combines both: sell services, document the results, and turn those results into affiliate content. If you prefer teaching, packaging your process as a course on <a href="/udemy/">Udemy</a> or <a href="/thinkific/">Thinkific</a> is a third income stream from the same skill.</p>

